; First Steps in Tigrinya / ትግርኛ (ti)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

ኣንቀሳቕስ box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
ወስኽ box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
ኣጉድል box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
ጻውዒት_ስርዓት box         ; Show the final candy count!
